    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for an adrenaline-pumping 3D bike racing adventure! Zoom through stunning environments with ultra-realistic graphics and smooth controls. Whether you're weaving through traffic or flying off ramps, every race feels real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic 3D graphics and dynamic environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple bikes to for the player to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart AI opponents with increasing difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied tracks: city, desert, forest and many more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race hard, ride free \u2014 the road is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
